   "data": {
    "text": "TRANSITIONS\nPatch any CV (0 to 10 V) into a jack. 0 V is the item's From setting, 10 V its To.\n\nCV-CC 1: MIDI channel 9, CC 1 to 10\n   1 Transition style\n   2 Clip animation\n   3 Fade in and out\n   4 Transition family\n   5 Intro and outro effect\n   6 suite: Classic and gentle\n   7 pair: When cutting gets fast, transitions become plain cuts\n   8 pair: When the feeling turns dreamlike, shots dissolve\n   9 pair: When the pace speeds up then stops, the scene fades out\n  10 pair: When the pace races then stops, an outro effect closes it"
   },
